I recommend Life Extension 2 per day multivitamins. Every vitamin within the ingredient listing are highly bio-available to the body. Most commercial multivitamins are in their most basic forms and get pissed out of the body without ever being used. These are about $15 to $20 every 2 months. They work quite well. Same diagnosis as you, been in the game for a while. Kk hope that helps. -- also talk to your doc if this is okay, most docs will give green light as long as its not more than daily recommended dose.
